WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.350
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do At The SCP Foundation: Yes, forum trolls

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.350
are annoying.

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:10.160
No, they don't automatically become D-class
personnel, Dr. Bright!

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.730
Personally, we’d think that someone who’s
lived as long as you - and died multiple times

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.150
- would have thicker skin.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:24.230
But your repeated insistence to turn forumites
like BootyHunter69 and DankyDankyLiteratureClub420

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:28.710
into D-Class personnel is as bizarre and sad
as they are nonsensical.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:32.529
People need to be truly despicable to warrant
having a place among the ranks of D-Class

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:33.550
personnel.

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:39.200
They need to be truly monstrous, evil, underhanded,
unethical, bottom-of-the-barrel individuals,

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.750
and frankly, forum trolls do not fit the bill.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.990
YouTube Commenters, on the other hand…

